<Base title="About" description="Who I am and what I work on.">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Stefano. I've been tinkering with computers since the days of hosting web servers
      on home routers, and I never really stopped.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today I work on embedded Linux: the full stack from boards and bootloaders to kernels,
      containers and over-the-air updates, and I lead the engineers who build it.
    </p>
    <p>This blog is where I write about:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hardware</strong>: boards, bring-up, debugging with a scope in one hand.</li>
      <li><strong>Software</strong>: Linux, build systems, tooling, the occasional rabbit hole.</li>
      <li><strong>Engineering</strong>: architecture, trade-offs, shipping reliable things.</li>
      <li><strong>Management</strong>: hiring, growing people, running teams that ship.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Find me on <a href="https://github.com/EstebanSannin">GitHub</a>, or follow along via
      <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
